Description: Pi-hole companion web interface for TelarWeb
 A modern web interface for managing Pi-hole DNS ad-blocker with
 advanced features including scheduling, domain management, and
 real-time statistics visualization.
 .
 Features:
  - Dashboard with real-time Pi-hole statistics
  - 24-hour trend visualization using Chart.js
  - Blocklist and allowlist management
  - Domain allow/deny rules
  - Advanced scheduling system with timezone support
  - Dark theme UI optimized for 24/7 monitoring
  - Supports both Pi-hole v5 and v6 APIs
 .
 Runs on port 8088 alongside the main TelarWeb dashboard.

